Package: mcp-server-semaphore
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-fastmcp (>= 2.0.0),
 python3-semaphore-client,
 python3-dotenv (>= 1.0.0),
Provides: semaphore-mcp-server
Replaces: semaphore-mcp-server (<< 0.1.3~)
Breaks: semaphore-mcp-server (<< 0.1.3~)
Description: Model Context Protocol server for Semaphore UI integration
 A comprehensive MCP server providing complete access to Semaphore UI API
 functionality through the Model Context Protocol, enabling AI assistants
 and other tools to interact with Semaphore automation platform.
 .
 Features include:
  * Project, template, task, and inventory management
  * Repository and environment management
  * SSH key and schedule management
  * Task launching, stopping, and output retrieval
  * User and event management
  * Server status and health monitoring
  * Support for both STDIO and HTTP transports

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-semaphore
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.1),
 mcp-server-semaphore (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Semaphore UI MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-semaphore. Installing it registers
 the semaphore-mcp binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
